    <string name="scr_price_faq_free_q">Is MotorMila free?</string>
    <string name="scr_price_faq_free_a">Yes. Searching listings, price ranges, price history and the import tax calculator are free while MotorMila is in beta. No card needed.</string>
    <string name="scr_price_faq_pro_q">When is Pro coming, and what will it cost?</string>
    <string name="scr_price_faq_pro_a">Soon. Pro is planned at LKR 999 a month. Leave your email and we\'ll tell you before it launches. Nothing is ever charged without your agreement.</string>
    <string name="scr_price_faq_source_q">Where do the listings come from?</string>
    <string name="scr_price_faq_source_a">From public ads on Sri Lankan vehicle sites. Every listing links back to the original ad and names its source.</string>
    <string name="scr_price_faq_dealer_q">I run a dealership. Is there a plan for me?</string>
    <string name="scr_price_faq_dealer_a_web">Yes. Starter covers up to 20 vehicles (LKR 2,990/mo), Pro up to 75 (LKR 6,990/mo), Yard is unlimited with team seats (LKR 14,990/mo). You can cancel any time.</string>
